list_dir("front-end/src/hooks")
list_dir("front-end/src/contexts")

// 5. Begin optimization implementation
// Implementation following the phases defined in implementation-front-end-performance.md
```

## 3. Specialized Implementation Structure

The front-end performance optimization implementation follows this specialized structure:

### Phase 1: Performance Analysis and Baseline

```typescript
// 1. Analyze component structure
list_dir("front-end/src/components")
list_dir("front-end/src/pages")
list_dir("front-end/src/hooks")

// 2. Identify performance bottlenecks
grep_search("useEffect", false, "front-end/src/**/*.tsx")
grep_search("useState", false, "front-end/src/**/*.tsx")
grep_search("useMemo|useCallback", false, "front-end/src/**/*.tsx")

// 3. Document performance baseline
edit_file("[planning_folder_path]/implementation-progress.md",
          "Document performance baseline",
          "# Implementation Progress: Front-End Performance Optimization\n\n## Performance Baseline\n\n- Component Render Counts\n- State Update Frequency\n- Memory Usage Patterns\n- Network Request Patterns\n- Bundle Size Analysis\n\n...")
```

### Phase 2: Component Rendering Optimization

```typescript
