          "Update implementation progress for component optimization",
          "# Implementation Progress: Front-End Performance Optimization\n\n## Phase 2: Component Rendering Optimization\n\n- Optimized [Component]: Added memoization\n- Optimized [Component]: Implemented useMemo for expensive calculations\n- Optimized [Component]: Implemented useCallback for event handlers\n\n...")
